<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ s/adj retail sales rose 2.3 pct in July.</title>
<headline>NZ s/adj retail sales rose 2.3 pct in July.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand (SNZ) on Tuesday released the following retail sales data for July.</p>
<p>Revised from figures are in brackets.</p>
<p>Seasonally-adjusted, month-on-month:</p>
<p>    July 1996		 June 1996	     July 1995</p>
<p>    +2.3 pct		  -3.2 (-3.6)	   -1.7 (-0.4)</p>
<p>Total actual retail sales (percentage change from same month previous year):</p>
<p>    July 1996		 June 1996	     July 1995</p>
<p>    +4.2 pct		   0.0 (+0.4)	   +5.4</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
</text>
